@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200452",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/dtc245200452/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Tao luot nop thieu du lieu -> 400 Bad Request + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Tao luot nop cho bai tap khong ton tai (999) -> 404 Not Found + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200452",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/dtc245200452/signalr"
}

### 7. Doc luot nop khong ton tai (id rong) -> 404 Not Found + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR (negotiate) -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bai tap 2: Tao luot nop URL khong bat dau bang https:// -> 201 Created, status = received
# @name createFailedSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200452-fail",
  "repositoryUrl": "http://example.com/dtc245200452-fail/signalr"
}

### 11. Bai tap 2: Doc lai luot nop loi sau ~3 giay: received -> processing -> failed -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createFailedSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
